# Essence Flux exiles Spirit of the Labyrinth and returns it as a new object (CR 400.7), then, because it is a Spirit, puts a +1/+1 counter on it.
# Cast twice: the second blink loses the first counter with the exiled object, so the Spirit has exactly one counter (4/2), never two. Black Lotus
# gives UUU, Mox Pearl the W for the Spirit.

